# L §8: "A load refusal stops the model before anything runs; one in a scenario file refuses only that scenario
# and the scenarios over it" (L §8.3, E §11).  child's version is named ola, which is also the key of the thing it
# enters: LOAD-KEY (L §2.5).  child and twins (over it) are refused; the base's ask c1 runs; c2, in child, is refused.
# Over the base of L6_4_scenario_stack (a gift of 100.00 PLN to each person monthly into konto) and its scenario
# child (a hypothetical child ola, a benefit move), with one change each.
=== household.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2030-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
kind gifts: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input gift_amt: money PLN
input gift_dom: int

move gift[m in months, p in persons on day_of(m, gift_dom)]: gifts
  on day_of(m, gift_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount gift_amt

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ana] lives 1990-04-02..
  gift_amt = 100.00 PLN "own"
  gift_dom = 5 "own"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask c1: count(p in persons on 2027-06-01)
ask c2: count(p in persons on 2027-06-01) in child
=== child.tally
scenario child over household
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
  note "a child in March 2027"

input benefit_amt: money PLN
move benefit[m in months, p in persons on day_of(m, gift_dom)]: gifts
  on day_of(m, gift_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  when p == ola
  leg cash from world to konto amount benefit_amt

version ola
  cite plan
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-10-15
  persons + [ola] lives 2027-03-01..
  benefit_amt = 50.00 PLN "benefit act"
=== twins.tally
scenario twins over child
  tally 2
  from 2028-01-01

version ela_born
  cite plan
  governs 2028..
  known 2026-10-20
  persons + [ela] lives 2028-02-01..
  replace benefit_amt = 80.00 PLN "benefit act, two children"

ask t1: bal(konto, 2028-12-31), bal(konto, 2028-12-31) as if {scenario child} in twins
=== expect
scenario child: refused: LOAD-KEY ...
scenario twins: refused: LOAD-KEY ...
c1: 1
  cut 2026-10-20
c2: refused: LOAD-KEY ...
